---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }]} title="Privacy Policy | MSDEVBUILD Azure" description="How MSDEVBUILD Azure handles your data: progress and scores stay in your own browser storage, with no account and no server-side tracking." wide={false}>
  <div class="lesson">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 11 November 2026</em></p>
    <h2 id="what">What we store</h2>
    <p>Your learning progress (completed topics, knowledge-check scores, mock exam results, badges) and your theme choice are stored in your browser's <code>localStorage</code> on your own device. An unfinished mock exam is kept in <code>sessionStorage</code> so a refresh does not lose it. None of this is sent to us.</p>
    <h2 id="accounts">Accounts</h2>
    <p>There are no accounts, sign-ups or passwords. We do not collect names or email addresses on this site.</p>
    <h2 id="third-party">Third parties</h2>
    <p>The site is served as static files. Links to Microsoft Learn and other sites are governed by those sites' own privacy policies.</p>
    <h2 id="control">Your control</h2>
    <p>You can erase everything at any time with “Reset my progress” on the <a href="/progress/">My Progress</a> page, or by clearing this site's data in your browser.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
